      "prompt": "Select **every** number that is correctly written in standard form.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$5.4 \\times 10^7$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$54.3 \\times 10^7$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$0.03 \\times 10^8$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$7.1 \\times 10^3 \\times 10^2$" },
        { "id": "e", "text": "$1 \\times 10^{-6}$" },
        { "id": "f", "text": "$9.99 \\times 10^{-12}$" }
      ],
      "answers": ["a", "e", "f"],
      "hints": ["The front number must be at least 1 and less than 10, with a single power of 10."],
      "explanation": "a, e and f are correct (1 is allowed; 10 is not). b's front number is too big, c's is too small, and d has two powers of 10 — it should be $7.1 \\times 10^5$."
